+/* Runs the capture recipe for this firmware.
+ *
+ * Measured on this unit (MateBook 13 WRT-WX9, firmware APP_14115), the same
+ * short recipe works for both the background and a finger press:
+ *
+ *     MCU state 0x55
+ *     FDT(0x36, 0x0d, boot zones)   -> configure the scan
+ *     NAV  (0x50)
+ *     FDT(0x36, 0x0d, background zones) -> settle the baseline
+ *     image (0x20)
