+ * The reference driver's separate "finger" recipe (finger-mode zones, a NOP,
+ * an arm via 0x32 then the image) does NOT work on this panel: the part answers
+ * the image request with a 0xD0 TLS-reconnect request and delivers no frame.
+ * That recipe belongs to the 88x80 panel of the GXFP51A0 this unit is not.
+ *
+ * The DAC registers the reference writes from OTP are likewise skipped: this
+ * unit's OTP block is 32 bytes, not the 64-byte layout those values are
+ * derived from, so there is no calibration to apply here. */
